[I] SANE backend for eSCL/AirScan and WSD network scanners

[T] sane-airscan is a universal SANE backend for eSCL (Apple AirScan) and WSD
[T] network scanners, allowing driverless scanning without a vendor-specific
[T] SANE driver.

[U] https://github.com/alexpevzner/sane-airscan

